From: OpenWrt RTL port
Subject: [PATCH] G6: resolve the station header relative to drv_types.h

OpenWrt stages net/mac80211/sta_info.h beside its public headers. Include
our private header locally so it cannot resolve to mac80211 internals.
Keep kernel/backports Linux header precedence unchanged: the G6 include
directory also contains a userspace-only linux/wireless.h.

--- a/include/drv_types.h
+++ b/include/drv_types.h
@@ -148,7 +148,7 @@
 #include <rtw_mib.h>
 #include "rtw_cfg.h"
 #include <osdep_intf.h>
-#include <sta_info.h>
+#include "sta_info.h"
 #include <rtw_event.h>
 #include <rtw_mlme_ext.h>
 #include "../core/rtw_dfs.h"
